    "https://www.newcastle.edu.au/our-uni/jobs/job-vacancies/application-process": {
      "title": "Application process",
      "description": "Application process / Job vacancies / Jobs at the University of Newcastle / Our Uni / The University of Newcastle, Australia Skip to content Our thoughts are with those who are affected by the devastating disaster in Nepal. Students requiring support can access support services here and staff can visit this page for information about our Employee Assistance Program . For emergency consular assistance information, please click here . The University of Newcastle, Australia Study Undergraduate Postgraduate International Admissions and Entry Pathways PhD and Research Masters New Students Scholarships Research Research impact Research stories Partner with us Institutes and centres Research facilities Graduate Research Research support Engage Alumni Business and industry Career-ready placements School and community programs Community partnerships Global Engagement Make a gift Volunteer Development projects Campus Life Newcastle Central Coast Sydney Tamworth Singapore Accommodation Respect Help on campus University Galleries Our Uni Strategic Plan Indigenous commitment Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Sustainability Our Stories Campuses and locations Colleges and Schools Our rankings Governance and leadership Jobs Library Students Staff 0 Degree comparison tool Add degrees to wishlist 0 Degree comparison tool Search Search Menu Homepage Our Uni Jobs at the University of Newcastle Job vacancies Application process Our Uni Our Uni Strategic Plan - Looking Ahead 2030 Indigenous Commitment Sustainability Equity, Diversity and Inclusion Campuses and locations Governance and leadership Jobs at the University of Newcastle Job vacancies Application process Collection Statement Coming from overseas? Rankings Contact Us Admissions Transparency Venues and Events NUServices Our Uni Application process Select the position that interests you from the job vacancies page. Check that you are eligible . Complete your application online and submit before the closing date. Applications for the position are considered and we will create a shortlist. We will invite shortlisted applicants to an interview . We will notify candidates if they have been successful or not. Tips for applying Read all information about the role so you understand what is required. Ensure the role is suited to your skills and qualifications. Follow all directions and complete all necessary fields of the application. In your selection criteria demonstrate clearly how your skills and experience meet each point. Do not go over four pages in total. Use plain English throughout your application. Help If you need help with the application process, please phone Human Resource Services on +61 2 4033 9999 or email employment@newcastle.edu.au . The University of Newcastle acknowledges the traditional custodians of the lands within our footprint areas:  Awabakal, Darkinjung, Biripai, Worimi, Wonnarua, and Eora Nations. We also pay respect to the wisdom of our Elders past and present. Quick links Degrees Library Maps Staff directory Canvas MyUni Online tools AskUON The Shop Information about Our Uni Strategic Plan Colleges and schools Campus life Jobs Make a gift Community partnerships Indigenous commitment Emergency and security Information for Research Business and Industry International students Alumni Current students Current staff News Media 中文(简体） Got a question? AskUON Connect with us Facebook Instagram TikTok LinkedIn Youtube WeChat Weibo Little Red Book The University of Newcastle, Australia © 2026 Contact us Copyright and Disclaimer Privacy Accessibility ABN 15 736 576 735 CRICOS Provider 00109J TEQSA Provider ID PRV12056 (Australian University) Back to top Are you visiting our site from South Asia ? Head to our dedicated page with all the information you need to study at the University of Newcastle. Close 您是否在中国访问我们的网址？ 前往 专属页面 ，查询你在纽卡斯尔大学学习所需的所有信息。 Close Library Students Staff Close Our Uni Home Study Research Engage Campus Life Our Uni Study Undergraduate Wher